        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVPRO19, Provence Egg Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Provence Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is available in dummy, passage and privacy functions. This 11 inch extra tall plate is great for bigger doors, but will still fit standard size doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Provence Egg Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate has a timeless elegance. It is available in a wide array of finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/provence-crystal-knob-with-fifth-avenue-plate-entryset-grandeur-favpro19entr\"><b> Provence Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate Entryset.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Crystal Provence Knob with Fifth Avenue Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Clear Provence Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.1\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVPRO19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262364\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVPRO19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
