                "description": "The Provence Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate is available in dummy, passage and privacy functions. This 11 inch extra tall plate is great for bigger doors, but will still fit standard size doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Provence Egg Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate has a timeless elegance. It is available in a wide array of finish colors.",
